msgid ""
"FXAA: THE RACE VIEWS' 3D, BEFORE THE HUD.\n"
"MSAA: EVERY PICTURE, MENUS TOO; MORE GPU.\n"
"AGSS: MSAA WITH THE 3D SHADED AT EVERY SAMPLE (SUPERSAMPLING):\n"
"TEXTURE EDGES (TREES, FENCES) AND SHIMMER TOO; MUCH MORE GPU."
msgstr ""
"FXAA: DAS 3D DER RENNANSICHTEN, VOR DEM HUD.\n"
"MSAA: JEDES BILD, AUCH MENÜS; MEHR GPU-LAST.\n"
"AGSS: MSAA, DAS 3D AN JEDEM SAMPLE SCHATTIERT (SUPERSAMPLING):\n"
"AUCH TEXTURKANTEN (BÄUME, ZÄUNE) UND FLIMMERN; VIEL MEHR GPU-LAST."

